Stealth is the word for this game.
Pros:
+ The game has an interesting story, you can believe on it;
+ Great scenario, there are realistc rooms and details;
+ The powers allow a non repetitive action, you can repeat them f you want, but you don't need to.
Cons:
- Some areas are long and in order to do it all unseen requires a lot of trial and error, you save and reload several times;
- I really miss weapons in this game;
- The AI is a little dumb;
It is a game that will be good for stealth and vampire fans.
